<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Amcoal appoints Campbell new chairman.</title>
<headline>Amcoal appoints Campbell new chairman.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anglo American Coal Corp Ltd said on Wednesday it had appointed James Campbell as chairman with immediate effect, succeeding Dave Rankin who is retiring after 46 years with the Anglo American group.</p>
<p>Campbell has been deputy chairman of Amcoal since May 1996.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
